@startuml
title Launch Manager Startup
autonumber "<b>[00]"

participant "Launch Manager" as LM
activate LM


[-> LM: Start Launch Manager

LM -> LM: Read configuration file

alt #pink Error in configuration file
    LM ->[ : Launch Manager terminates
end alt
LM -> LM: Preallocate internal resources (memory, thread pool, ipc channels, etc.)

alt #pink Not enough resources available
    LM ->[ : Launch Manager terminates
end alt

LM -> LM: Initialize external monitor connection

alt #pink Failure during watchodog initialization
    LM ->[ : Launch Manager terminates
end alt

LM -> LM: Build dependency graph
LM -> LM: Start transition to initial Run Target: Running

=== Start Transition to Run Target "Running" ==

...


@enduml
